## Raise Dependabot security floors

Context: GitHub Dependabot listed open alerts on `uv.lock` and
`src/mcp-server/uv.lock` for PyJWT, GitPython, urllib3, anyio,
cryptography, MLflow, sentence-transformers, oauthlib, and NLTK.
The same floors were applied on 0.8.1. Patched releases were available
for all except oauthlib 4.x (blocked by `databricks-sql-connector`
`oauthlib<4`) and NLTK GHSA-8mgp-746c-j5xp (no upstream patch).

Changes:

1. pyproject.toml
   Raise MLflow to ≥3.16.1, sentence-transformers to ≥5.6.0, and uv
   constraint floors for gitpython, urllib3, anyio, pyjwt, cryptography.
2. src/mcp-server/pyproject.toml
   Add PyJWT, urllib3, and anyio floors next to the existing cryptography 50 floor.
3. uv.lock / src/mcp-server/uv.lock
   Relock; rewrite proxy URLs back to files.pythonhosted.org.
4. docs/development.md
   Document the new floors and the two blocked advisories.
5. releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.9.0.md
   Add a Dependabot security section.

Modified files:
- pyproject.toml
- src/mcp-server/pyproject.toml
- uv.lock
- src/mcp-server/uv.lock
- docs/development.md
- releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.9.0.md
- changelogs/v0.9.0/benoitcayladbx_2026-10-01.log

Tests: uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario" → 7199 passed, 315 skipped, 6 deselected, 1 xfailed, 32 warnings in 51.04s

## Confirm Ontology Studio icon remapping

Context: Clicking Auto-map icons in Ontology Studio stopped with
"All entities already have custom icons" once every class had a custom
emoji. Users needed a way to replace those icons after confirmation.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   When no default-icon candidates remain, ask via showConfirmDialog and
   remap every entity if the user confirms; keep mixed default/custom
   assignment one-click.
2. tests/units/front/test_ontology_icon_remap_confirmation.py
   Source-contract coverage for confirmation copy, cancel, full remap,
   running-task guard, and missing-helper safety.
3. docs/features.md
   Document the remap confirmation on Auto-Map Icons.
4. docs/architecture.md
   Document the Studio toolbar candidate selection and remap confirm path.

