## Add Ontology Studio multi-select gestures

Context: Ontology Studio selected one entity at a time. Users need
Ctrl/Cmd-click and Ctrl/Cmd-marquee selection so later tasks can move,
delete, and create Business Views from a set. Pan/zoom and single-click
selection stay unchanged.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Add selection Set helpers, Ctrl/Cmd toggle, modifier-only marquee,
   Escape clear, and zoom.filter so modifier-primary drags do not pan.
2. src/front/static/ontology/css/ontology-map.css
   Style `.map-selection-marquee` with `--db-primary` tokens.
3. tests/units/front/test_ontology_map_multi_select.py
   Source contracts for modifier click, marquee replace, and Escape.

